    "detailed_description": "Foxhaven is an online multiplayer game designed for 3 vs 1 3D action multi-player game.<br />\r\n <br />\r\nIn this game, 4 players participate, with 1 player assuming the role of THE FOX. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe objective is for the villagers to escape from the village without falling victim to THE FOX's schemes. <br />\r\nTo do so, they must find 6 keys scattered throughout the village.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe central conflict revolves around the villagers' goal to identify who among them is THE FOX and to share this crucial information with their fellow players. Meanwhile, THE FOX aims to eliminate all the villagers before they can escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEffective communication is pivotal for the villagers as they must swiftly discern the identity of THE FOX and disseminate this information to all players. Conversely, THE FOX endeavors to maintain a covert identity while discreetly eliminating villagers one by one.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you escape from Foxhaven Village?",
    "about_the_game": "Foxhaven is an online multiplayer game designed for 3 vs 1 3D action multi-player game.<br />\r\n <br />\r\nIn this game, 4 players participate, with 1 player assuming the role of THE FOX. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe objective is for the villagers to escape from the village without falling victim to THE FOX's schemes. <br />\r\nTo do so, they must find 6 keys scattered throughout the village.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe central conflict revolves around the villagers' goal to identify who among them is THE FOX and to share this crucial information with their fellow players. Meanwhile, THE FOX aims to eliminate all the villagers before they can escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEffective communication is pivotal for the villagers as they must swiftly discern the identity of THE FOX and disseminate this information to all players. Conversely, THE FOX endeavors to maintain a covert identity while discreetly eliminating villagers one by one.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you escape from Foxhaven Village?",
    "short_description": "Foxhaven is a gripping 3 vs 1 3D action multiplayer game. Among the four villagers, one is an Impostor, THE FOX. To avoid getting killed, the villagers must find six keys and escape from the village!",
